function outcomes(type){const vals=type==='call'?['pastor','secretary','voicemail','noanswer1','noanswer2','other']:type==='text'||type==='email'?['sent','received','conversation','other']:type==='visit'?['completed','other']:['note','other'];return vals.map((v,i)=>`<label class="outcome" data-result="${v}" style="margin:0"><input type="radio" name="result" value="${v}" ${i===0?'checked':''} required>${icon(resultIcons[v]||'note')}<span>${resultNames[v]}</span></label>`).join('');}
